{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52974","headline":"与郑辕崔全素游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 薜荔壁 · 薛晏","name":"与郑辕崔全素游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 薜荔壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁种薜荔花？盘根上幽石。\n玲珑珠缀晓，香霭岑岚夕。\n却误贪寝人，遗衣挂苔壁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛晏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}